  "title": "Easy Fish Tacos with Mango-Pineapple Slaw",
  "description": "Warm-weather fruits like mango and pineapple add a tropical flavor to a simple mango slaw for fish tacos made with baked cod.",
  "authors": [
    "mleiland"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:48:45-04:00",
